# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VELOUR Bot — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to:  .env
# 2. Fill in your actual values below
# 3. NEVER commit .env to GitHub — it is already in .gitignore
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your Meta Graph API Access Token
# Get this from: Meta App Dashboard → Messenger → Access Tokens
ACCESS_TOKEN=your_meta_access_token_here

# Your custom Webhook Verify Token
# This is ANY string YOU choose — just make it hard to guess
# Example: velour_webhook_secret_2024
VERIFY_TOKEN=your_verify_token_here

# Groq API Key (only needed if using responses_groq.py)
# Get this free from: console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
